Note on the artwork: Vincent van Gogh's "The Starry Night" (1889) is in the
public domain (author died in 1890). The digital scan used here comes from
Wikimedia Commons (Google Art Project). This project is an artistic and
technical tribute and claims no rights over the original painting.
